{#
Composing with no mail account at all.

Reachable only on a fresh install — which is exactly when it used to be a 500,
because Message::setAccount() is not nullable and defaultAccount() had nothing
to give it. A dead end with a way out beats a stack trace.
#}
{# Arrives in the dock, in the slot the compose window would have filled, so it
   arrives the same way the window does. Anything else and pressing Compose
   animates on the days it works and blinks on the days it does not.

   Wrapped in the frame the click asked for, as _window.html.twig is. Without
   it Turbo finds no matching frame in the answer and raises
   turbo:frame-missing, and compose--dock takes that for a failed request: the
   card never showed, and a fresh install got "The compose window could not be
   opened. Please try again." — a retry that can never work. #}
<turbo-frame id="{{ app.request.headers.get('Turbo-Frame') ?: 'compose_dock' }}">
<div data-enter="fade" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="compose-no-account-heading"
     class="relative w-80 rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface shadow-lg p-6 text-center">
    {# The dock's own card has a dismiss; so does this one. compose--dock
       clears the frame, as it does for its error card. #}
    <button type="button" data-action="compose--dock#dismiss"
            class="absolute top-2.5 right-3 text-ink-faint hover:text-ink transition-colors"
            aria-label="{{ 'compose.open_failed.dismiss'|trans }}">&times;</button>

    <div class="mx-auto w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-sunken flex items-center justify-center">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope text-ink-faint" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    </div>

    <h2 id="compose-no-account-heading" class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-ink">{{ 'compose.no_account.heading'|trans }}</h2>
    <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">{{ 'compose.no_account.body'|trans }}</p>

    {# _top: inside the frame, a plain link would load Settings into the
       compose slot and fail the same way the card used to. #}
    <a href="{{ path('app_settings_index', { section: 'accounts' }) }}" data-turbo-frame="_top"
       class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center justify-center h-9 px-4 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-accent-ink
              bg-accent hover:bg-accent-strong transition-colors">
        {{ 'compose.no_account.cta'|trans }}
    </a>
</div>
</turbo-frame>
